  "description": "No matter where you ride, the 140 can rip. The tried-and-true trail setup that ascends and descends with equal ease. Do a little of everything? The 140 is for you.\n\nThe true \"all around\" trail bike\n\n150mm front, 140mm rear\n\nAlchemy Premium Carbon Fiber\n\nFox Factory Suspension and Dropper\n\nIndustry Nine wheels and hubs\n\nMullet wheel compatible\n\nThe 140 is the trail breed of our MTB platform. The true “all-around” bike with a Fox Factory 36 (150mm) fork and 140mm of travel in the rear, this thing can climb, descend, and play with ease.\n\nThe more you throw at this bike, the more you’ll be impressed with yourself! Crush your PRs, let it rip downhill, and feel the confidence of the perfect bike for you.\n\nThe Arktos 140 utilizes its modern geo and patented Sine Suspension to keep the pedaling smooth and efficient. Despite all its pedaling efficiency, there’s 150/140mm of Fox Factory top-of-the-line suspension to help you cruise along while sending the big stuff.\n\nOne Arktos to RIDE Them All:\nMullet Option: Arktos 140 and 150 models are also available in a ‘mullet’ setup, with a 29″ front wheel and 27.5″ rear which is gaining traction quickly in MTB, and has been used for years in motocross. The larger front hoop flows over big hits, while the smaller rear wheel provides quicker acceleration.\n\nConversion Kits: Quickly transform your 140 into a 125 or 150 (and back again) with Alchemy’s conversion kits: Get two (or three) bikes in one – for a fraction of the cost of buying a second bike – and always have the ideal rig for your immediate riding plans. Kits include corresponding shock, fork, and any necessary links.",
